etogenic plan one huge reason  why they might even feel so much better  is not even necessarily the lowering of  the carbohydrates it is the abstinence  of eating these grains  that  eliminate  a lot of the inflammation that is going  on in the gut and then all the  associated symptoms  so  i want to challenge you just to  avoid eating bread okay for one week  okay in fact avoid all grains for one  week and just see how you feel  then the next week go back to eating  bread and grains and then see how you  feel and then compare these two and then  decide whether it's worth it or not now  if you have not seen my video  on  sugar and how that affects the red blood  cell that's a real interesting video i'm  going to put that one up right here  check it out  you
 

